{{!
    @template local_xentreeconnect/launch_form

    Form that posts the signed launch assertion to Xentree. The local_xentreeconnect/launch AMD module submits it
    automatically; without JavaScript the button submits it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formid - Id of the form element
    * action - Xentree launch URL
    * assertion - Signed launch assertion (JWT)
    * redirecting - Text shown while redirecting
    * continuelabel - Submit button label

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formid": "xentreeconnect-launch-form",
        "action": "https://my.xentree.ai/connect/v1/launch/example-client",
        "assertion": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJtb29kbGUtdXNlci0xIn0.c2lnbmF0dXJl",
        "redirecting": "Taking you to Xentree…",
        "continuelabel": "Continue to Xentree"
    }
}}
<div class="local-xentreeconnect-launch my-3" data-region="local-xentreeconnect-launch">
    <p>{{redirecting}}</p>
    <form id="{{formid}}" method="post" action="{{action}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="assertion" value="{{assertion}}">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">{{continuelabel}}</button>
    </form>
</div>
